---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<aside class="legal-boundary-note" aria-label="Trustora legal identity and service boundary">
  <div>
    <span class="section-label">Legal identity &amp; service boundary</span>
    <p><strong>{site.legalName}</strong> is a {site.jurisdiction} entity. Trustora coordinates employment administration and related services; country-specific legal, tax, immigration, and employment advice may require qualified local professionals.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="inline-link" href="/legal/entities/">Read the legal identity note <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</aside>

<style>
  .legal-boundary-note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: end;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(11, 39, 64, 0.2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11, 39, 64, 0.2);
  }

  .legal-boundary-note p {
    max-width: 58rem;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .legal-boundary-note strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .legal-boundary-note {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
